---
description: One scope per agent, small diff, draft pull request only
alwaysApply: true
---

# Workflow

- One agent, one scope. Leave files outside that scope unchanged, including another agent's branch.
- Keep the diff small. Prefer docs and agent config in this repo unless the task explicitly targets something else.
- Open one draft pull request. Leave it in draft.
- Do not merge. Do not push to `main`.
- Edit `.github/workflows` only when that workflow is the task. Do not change workflow behavior for agent-setup tasks.
